{"id":"vod_sn_36222","vodId":"36222","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"穿透幻影的太阳","name_cn":"穿透幻影的太阳","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/801a313a357bf7ba6cd2e104f5dc9407.jpg"},"summary":"这个世界分为善和恶两个部分。恶魔塔罗牌掌控着属于恶的黑暗世界，而自然塔罗牌则身为抗衡黑暗的存在，一直制约着恶魔塔罗牌对于世界的吞噬。太阳灯里（门胁舞以 配音）是一个平凡的少女，幻想着能够成为和母亲一样的塔罗牌占卜师。一天夜里，灯里突然遭到了魔物的袭击，塔罗牌的力量将灯舞带进了一个魔幻的世界之中国，在那里，灯舞是手持长剑的剑士。　　原来，这个世界上存在着拥有成为精灵塔罗牌的使用者的特殊能力的少女，而灯里就是其中一个。在灯里的力量觉醒之后，她被相关部门带往了一所专门保护和训练这样的少女的学校之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:41:22","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FUv5t4vZ2w1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cRg3vhXL8z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3sbRwStNk61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XtqzpfCBiS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2zi1gqwgWw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/m7nMsviz4g1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/crkzNqkndg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jv7AV7p3PX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vcKHqrc74J1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qryyt9tuA51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gSxu7VRF8G1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MfmQcJwAwv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kw7rFnwqEL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Pb1S1Y6Wqk1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:25.081Z"}